            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Закодируй значение <code>oxygen</code>, а затем <code>\"88.81%\"</code> внутри кортежа.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"composition = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;oxygen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;88.81%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(composition)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('oxygen', '88.81%')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>\"oxygen\"</code>, затем <code>,</code>, и наконец <code>\"88.81%\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Заполни кортеж так, чтобы код вывел <code>('oxygen', '88.81%')</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"composition = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;oxygen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;88.81%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(composition)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"oxygen\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"88.81\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('oxygen', '88.81%')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>\"oxygen\"</code>, затем <code>,</code>, и наконец <code>\"88.81%\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
